TSDataSet Name=Input TS DataSet for FRM_H
Description=FRM-Only operations. No BiOp or Dam Safety IRRMs. Useful for FRM assessments (e.g. flow-frequency that downstream communities should plan for).

Some BiOp operations can provide an incidental flood risk management benefit by keeping the reservoir lower, creating more space to store water during a flood. EM 1110-2-1415 (USACE 1993) states that when accounting for these types of operations, their effect on FRM should be estimated very conservatively. The FRM-only operational regime only includes those operations considered dependable or reliable for FRM purposes

3Hour timestep sufficient to capture FRM ops. (TS Data Set)

